<view class="page home-page">
  <view class="home-brand"><view class="brand-seal">时</view><view>人生时光机</view></view>
  <view class="home-hero"><view class="hero-title">想看看<text>另一个年龄的你</text></view><view class="hero-description">一个人，或和喜欢的人一起。<text>从一张照片开始，留下一本岁月相册。</text></view></view>
  <view class="mode-card"><view class="mode-number">01</view><view class="mode-content"><view class="section-title">走过一生</view><view class="muted">0–100 岁，每 5 年一张</view><view class="mini-years" aria-hidden="true"><text>0</text><view></view><text>25</text><view></view><text>50</text><view></view><text>75</text><view></view><text>100</text></view><view class="mode-note">21 张，整套 ¥9.90</view></view><view class="mode-count">21<text>张</text></view></view>
  <view class="mode-card"><view class="mode-number">02</view><view class="mode-content"><view class="section-title">停在某一岁</view><view class="muted">选一个年龄，看看那时的模样</view><view class="mode-note">0–100 岁 · 1 张 ¥5.90</view></view><view class="mode-count">1<text>张</text></view></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">一生衣橱</view><text class="tag">整系列 ¥9.90</text></view><view class="muted">为已生成的照片换一身装扮。一个主题内，全部适用款式一起珍藏。</view></view>
  <button class="button hero-button" bindtap="start">选照片，开始创作</button><view class="hero-trust">支持单人照与双人合照 · 作品默认私密</view>
  <view class="home-section"><view class="home-steps"><view><text>1</text>选照片</view><view><text>2</text>选年龄</view><view><text>3</text>保存照片</view></view></view>
  <view class="home-account" wx:if="{{authenticated}}"><button class="button secondary" bindtap="commerce">我的订单</button><button class="button secondary" bindtap="service">帮助与客服</button></view>
  <view class="home-account" wx:else><button class="button secondary" bindtap="login">微信登录</button></view>
  <view class="privacy-foot">照片带 AI 生成标识，不代表真实容貌预测。每位人物都需要本人或监护人的有效授权。</view>
</view>
